### E;

A dataoack that adds re-worked recipies for planks, stairs, slabs, trapdoors, pressure plates, buttons, and doors!

This datapack only has blcoks up to cherry for now, and doors will be added later. This pack is very generic and bare-bones in it's crafting, as many others have done this but don't worry! More is to come! I do plan on adding cutting, smelting and other recipies to this pack, while keeping it balenced!
